      "t": "Chef Viktor calls Elena to apologize for all the trouble and asks for a ride on an important errand, while back in the kitchen Fedya demands five thousand rubles from Senya after proving a person really can eat a belt. Let's listen closely to their exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
