    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я хотел извиниться.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I wanted to apologize.' Calling Elena on the phone, Barinov says he wanted to apologize for earlier.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Куча проблем из-за меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A lot of problems because of me.' He admits she has dealt with a pile of trouble today because of him.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Отвезите меня по важному делу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Drive me for an important matter.' Then he slyly asks her to drive him on one 'important errand' across town.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я пришлю адрес.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will send the address.' He promises to text her the address right away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Проспорил пять тысяч?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You lost the bet. Five thousand?' Back in the kitchen, after watching the guest force Senya to eat the belt, Fedya asks for his five thousand rubles. Senya answers straight away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Чего?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What?' Still recovering from chewing leather, Senya stares at him and asks 'what?'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Мы спорили.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We bet.' Fedya reminds him of the exact wording of their bet.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Может ли человек съесть ремень.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If a person could eat a belt.' They bet on whether a human being could eat a leather belt. Then Senya replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Да.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes.' Senya reluctantly mutters 'yes'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Ты доказал, что может.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You proved they could.' Fedya grins and points out that Senya himself just proved a person can eat one.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Гони деньги.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pay up.' Laughing, Fedya tells him to cough up the five grand. And Senya jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Я тебя убью.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
